# Production backend origin for the NovaChat client.
#
# Do NOT hardcode this in the repo — set it in the Vercel dashboard instead
# (Project → Settings → Environment Variables → VITE_API_URL), so the origin
# is never committed and can differ per environment.
#
# Vercel dashboard values take precedence over this file at build time.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-server.onrender.com
